st column.\n   ```\n   856564531\n   +643645481\n   ------\n   1499999912\n   ```\n   So, the sum of 856564531 and 643645481 is 1499999912.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe sum of 856564531 and 643645481 is 1499999912.\n</answer>\n"]
