messages:  ["Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 364549795 and 487044830? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 364549795 and 487044830, we need to follow these steps:\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, ensuring that the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of digits in any column is 10 or more, carry over the extra digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n</think>\n<answer>\nLet's perform the addition step by step:\n```\n  364549795\n+ 487044830\n-----------\n```\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):\n5 + 0 = 5\n9 + 3 = 12 (write down 2, carry over 1)\n7 + 8 + 1 (carried over) = 16 (write down 6, carry over 1)\n4 + 4 + 1 (carried over) = 9\n5 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 6\n4 + 7 = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1)\n6 + 8 + 1 (carried over) = 15 (write down 5, carry over 1)\n3 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 11 (write down 1, carry over 1)\n3 + 4 + 1 (carried over) = 8\n```\n  364549795\n+ 487044830\n-----------\n  851594625\n```\nThe sum of 364549795 and 487044830 is 851594625.\n</answer>\n"]
